WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
20 forts of the Sahyadri, climbed over 5 years.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:15.200
In the order they were climbed: Tikona, Vasota, Kalavantin Durga, Bhimashankar To Bhorgiri, Katraj To Sinhgad, Jivdhan, Bhimashankar to Padarwadi, Talgad, Harishchandragad, Ghangad Fort.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.200
6 easy, 11 medium, 3 hard. 10 of them written up.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.200
The longest: Panhala to Pawankhind, 22 hours on foot.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Some take two hours. One took 22. 72 hours on the trail. sankettambare.in/treks
